/// Assigns one or more tags (key-value pairs) to the specified CloudWatch
/// resource, such as a service level objective. Tags can help you organize
/// and categorize your resources. You can also use them to scope user
/// permissions by granting a user permission to access or change only
/// resources with certain tag values. Tags don't have any semantic meaning
/// to Amazon Web Services and are interpreted strictly as strings of
/// characters. You can use the TagResource action with an alarm that
/// already has tags. If you specify a new tag key for the alarm, this tag
/// is appended to the list of tags associated with the alarm. If you
